      "writtenOn": "2022-12-12T19:19:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think this impl has two problems:\n\n- It needs to read the whole HealthInfo, which contains other unnecessary info\n- It doesn\u0027t count for the case when a device doesn\u0027t support it (it just returns ok() consistently).\n\nHence, I think this should be changed to:\n\n```\nndk::ScopedAStatus Health::getBatteryHealthData(BatteryHealthData* out) {\n    if (auto res \u003d GetProperty(..., BATTERY_PROP_MANUFACTURING_DATE, ...); !res.ok()) return res;    \n    // same for first usage\n}\n```\n\n(You\u0027ll need to add `BATTERY_PROP_MANUFACTURING_DATE`)\n\n(Or you can add two new functions in BatteryMonitor)",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 129,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 141,
        "endChar": 1
      },
      "revId": "63c72912698dff1add275f257af6412356292cf1",
